# coherence/canon: rulings on every conflict finding of the twelve inventories (and the canon's own).
# Each entry: fid -> (verdict, ruling, basis, units). verdict: FIX (change at the named units) | FIX-BY-F (an f/g item
# applied as written resolves it) | INVALID (not a defect, reason given). basis cites the precedence of principle (3).
R = {}
def r(fid, verdict, ruling, basis, units):
    R[fid] = {'verdict': verdict, 'ruling': ruling, 'basis': basis, 'units': units}

